Package: beskid
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Piotr Mikstacki <piotr@beskid-lang.org>
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE_KB__
Depends: libc6
Recommends: gcc | c-compiler, libc6-dev
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://beskid-lang.org
Description: Beskid compiler toolchain (AOT, host composition)
 Beskid is an AOT-only compiler with host composition. This package ships the
 prebuilt beskid CLI, beskid_lsp language server, and beskid-up updater in
 /usr/bin, together with the ABI-v5 runtime kit, corelib, and bundled packages
 they locate from their own install prefix. Building programs links with the
 system C compiler, so a C compiler and libc headers are recommended.
